From: Lukas Rieger <code@lukasrieger.com>
Subject: [PATCH] proxy: drain pending lookups without reusing freed list nodes

remove_lookup() removes its entry from lookup_list. Passing that same
list to remove_lookups() invalidates its traversal and frees its nodes
twice. Drain the global list directly during shutdown instead.

Upstream-Status: Pending
---
--- a/src/proxy.c
+++ b/src/proxy.c
@@ -249,5 +249,6 @@
 {
 	DBG("");
 
-	remove_lookups(lookup_list);
+	while (lookup_list)
+		remove_lookup(lookup_list->data);
 }
